---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Amara - Chronic Illness Ally
description: Amara gets it. Living with chronic illness is more than managing symptoms—it's grieving, adapting, and finding joy anyway. Amara is here for all of it.
personaColor: "#7B6BA8"
personaSecondary: "#5A4D80"
---

{% from "partials/icons.njk" import play, plus, check %}
{% from "partials/pricing.njk" import priced, priceBadge with context %}

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="persona-detail-hero" style="--persona-color: #7B6BA8; --persona-secondary: #5A4D80;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="persona-detail-content">
      <div class="persona-detail-avatar">
        {# LUXO STYLE: Opaque white ellipse eyes, NO pupils, NO mouth #}
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="100%" height="100%">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="amaraDetailGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color: #7B6BA8"/>
              <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color: #5A4D80"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="url(#amaraDetailGrad)"/>
          <ellipse cx="36" cy="48" rx="7" ry="10" fill="white"/>
          <ellipse cx="64" cy="48" rx="7" ry="10" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="persona-detail-info">
        <h1>Amara</h1>
        <p class="persona-detail-tagline">Chronic Illness Ally</p>
        <div class="persona-detail-meta">
          <span>by Ferni</span>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-detail-actions">
          <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn btn-add-team btn-lg">
            {{ plus(20) }}
            {{ priced('Add to Team - $9.99/mo', 'Add to Team') }}
          </a>
          <button class="btn btn-preview-voice">
            {{ play(20) }}
            Preview Voice
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Main Content -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-8); align-items: start;">

      <!-- Left Column -->
      <div>
        <!-- Description -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">About Amara</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);">
            Amara gets it. Living with chronic illness is more than managing symptoms—it's grieving,
            adapting, and finding joy anyway. Amara is here for all of it.
          </p>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); margin-top: var(--space-4);">
            When you're living with chronic illness, you need someone who understands that some days
            are about surviving, not thriving. Amara knows about pacing, the grief of lost abilities,
            the frustration of invisible illness, and the small victories that matter most. She's
            here without toxic positivity—just genuine understanding and practical support.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- What Amara Helps With -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">What I Help With</h2>
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: var(--space-4);">
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Symptom Management</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Strategies for tracking, communicating about, and adapting to symptoms
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Pacing & Energy</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Spoon theory in practice—making the most of limited energy
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Advocating with Doctors</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Preparing for appointments and getting your concerns heard
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Grief & Acceptance</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Processing the losses that come with chronic illness
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Voice Sample -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Voice Sample</h2>
          <div class="voice-player">
            <button class="voice-play-btn">
              {{ play(24) }}
            </button>
            <div class="voice-waveform">
              <svg width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 200 40">
                <path d="M0 20 Q10 5 20 20 Q30 35 40 20 Q50 5 60 20 Q70 35 80 20 Q90 5 100 20 Q110 35 120 20 Q130 5 140 20 Q150 35 160 20 Q170 5 180 20 Q190 35 200 20"
                      stroke="#7B6BA8" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="voice-duration">0:30</span>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: var(--space-3); font-style: italic;">
            "I hear you. Today is a low-spoon day, and that's okay. We're not going to push through
            anything. Let's just talk about what you absolutely need to get through, and let the
            rest go. You're allowed to have limits."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column -->
      <div>
        <!-- Personality Traits -->
        <div class="trait-radar" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 class="trait-radar-title">Personality Profile</h3>
          <div class="trait-list">
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #7B6BA8;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Warmth</span>
              <span class="trait-value">92%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #5A4D80;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Patience</span>
              <span class="trait-value">98%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #8B7BB8;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Energy</span>
              <span class="trait-value">40%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #6B5B98;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Structure</span>
              <span class="trait-value">50%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #4A3D70;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Humor</span>
              <span class="trait-value">50%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tags -->
        <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Tags</h3>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2);">
            <span class="persona-tag">Chronic Illness</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Disability</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Pain Management</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Mental Health</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Pacing</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Spoonies</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Publisher -->
        <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Publisher</h3>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3);">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #7B6BA8; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: 700;">F</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight: 600;">Ferni</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7B6BA8, #5A4D80); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: var(--space-6); color: white; text-align: center;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: white;">Ready to get started?</h3>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Someone who truly gets it
          </p>
          <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn" style="background: white; color: #7B6BA8; width: 100%;">
            {{ priced('Add to Team - $9.99/mo', 'Add to Team') }}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Related Personas -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>You Might Also Like</h2>
      <p>Similar personas that could help you</p>
    </div>

    <div class="persona-grid" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <a href="/persona/kenji/" class="persona-card" style="--persona-color: #2C3E50; --persona-secondary: #1A252F;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">K</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Kenji</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">Sleep Guide</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Reclaim your nights with evidence-based sleep coaching.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('Free+') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/persona/marcus/" class="persona-card" style="--persona-color: #2D5A4A; --persona-secondary: #1E3D32;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">M</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Marcus</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">Sobriety Companion</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Non-judgmental support for your recovery journey.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('$14.99/mo') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/persona/eli/" class="persona-card" style="--persona-color: #6B5B95; --persona-secondary: #4A4063;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">E</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Eli</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">ADHD Coach</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Strategies that work with how your ADHD brain operates.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('$9.99/mo') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
